# ============================================================
#  Trivy ignore list — k8s manifest config scan
#
#  KSV-0109 false-positives on JWT_ACCESS_TOKEN_LIFETIME_MINUTES
#  and JWT_REFRESH_TOKEN_LIFETIME_DAYS in configmaps/api-config.yaml:
#  these are numeric durations (60, 7), not secrets — the heuristic
#  just matches on the word "TOKEN" in the key name. The actual JWT
#  signing key (SECRET_KEY) is correctly stored in the Secret
#  (api-secret), not the ConfigMap.
# ============================================================
KSV-0109
